  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 67555909632
    m_Localized: "I always found it incredibly crude and ill-mannered to bang on a door as if calling cattle. In contrast, I have always been fond of the sound of bells. The soft, melodic tinkling that announces someone\u2019s arrival strikes me as the perfect way to welcome a guest."
